 rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://humanresources.paradoxplaza.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://humanresources.paradoxplaza.com/</a><br /> Seems World of Darkness is getting some.</div> </div> </div> </div>About that...<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/te9NDif.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3771-damoqles","name":"damoqles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T20:57:10-08:00","id":846422,"title":"","content":"Give me Crusader Kings/Total War where you play as either a Vampire elder or a Mummy. Can your mortal servants gain enough sway to impose your will on the world without exposing you to enemies and Hunters? Bonus points if you can customize your Cult somewhat and have to deal with heresies/schisms over the ages as generations of cultists mistranslate and misinterpret your wishes.<br /> <br /> It would be especially fun if after a certain number of turns you had to succumb to torpor/Duat, and then come to much later to see just how wrong things went.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 03-13-2016, 12:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"r